---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Hardware & Engineering">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Hardware Engineering</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">From acrylic sketches to an enclosed 3D-printed chassis.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-16">
    <!-- Mechanics -->
    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-1 bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/10 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-col">
        <img src="/images/coxa_model.png" alt="Coxa CAD Model" class="w-full h-48 object-contain mb-6 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg border border-white/5 p-2" />
        <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500 pl-3 mt-auto">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Coxa (X-Axis)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Rotates the entire leg horizontally (left/right). Determines the leg's placement around the body radius.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-1 bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/10 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-col">
        <img src="/images/femur_model.png" alt="Femur CAD Model" class="w-full h-48 object-contain mb-6 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg border border-white/5 p-2" />
        <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500 pl-3 mt-auto">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Femur (Y-Axis)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Raises the foot off the ground during a step and supports the robot's main weight payload.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-1 bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/10 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-col">
        <img src="/images/tibia_model.png" alt="Tibia CAD Model" class="w-full h-48 object-contain mb-6 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg border border-white/5 p-2" />
        <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500 pl-3 mt-auto">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Tibia (Z-Axis)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Extends/retracts the lower leg, adjusting the reach and allowing precise foot placement on uneven terrain.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Prototypes -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8">Evolution & Prototypes</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Prototype 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-1/3">
            <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-1">Iteration 1</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Acrylic Skeleton</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="md:w-2/3 text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-3">
            <p>Focused on testing basic geometry and proportions using cut acrylic and hot glue. Basic PCA9685 servo movements were tested.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Issue:</strong> Acrylic joints were incredibly weak and connections routinely failed, preventing load-bearing tests.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Prototype 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-1/3">
            <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-1">Iteration 2</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Flat 3D Platform</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="md:w-2/3 text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-3">
            <p>Transitioned to CAD models and 3D printing (PETG). Mounted an ESP board and introduced Inverse Kinematics code for accurate XYZ targeting.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Issue:</strong> Once batteries and components were loaded, servo torque limits were exceeded. A single flat body plate was inadequate for protecting wiring.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Prototype 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(52,211,153,0.05)]">
          <div class="bg-slate-950 p-4 border-b border-emerald-500/20">
            <img src="/images/main_body.png" alt="Final Enclosed Body CAD" class="w-full h-64 object-contain" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
            <div class="md:w-1/3">
              <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-1">Final Iteration</div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Enclosed Core</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-2/3 text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-3">
              <p>Shortened leg lengths to reduce mechanical leverage (lowering torque requirements). Designed a fully enclosed 3D chassis to protect electronics. Shifted heavy battery packs off-board to a wired umbilical to ensure the robot could demonstrate IK maneuvers.</p>
              <p><strong class="text-white">Outcome:</strong> Stable platform capable of processing AI inputs and executing Tripod Gaits.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>